README.OSK -- rn 4.3 on this diskThis directory is Bob Larson's OS-9 port of rn 4.3 as the Microware OS-9archive carried it (TELECOM/file4352), with one file changed and theoriginal beside it as config.h.ori:  config.h    LIB, ACTIVE, SPOOL and INCOMING follow the C News layout on              this disk -- /h0/USR/LIB/CNEWS and /h0/SPOOL/CNEWS -- where              Larson's system had /h0/ulib/news and /h0/spool/news; RNLIB is              /h0/USR/LIB/RN; and SITENAME, the name Pnews signs articles              with, is osk.UUCP instead of Larson's own blars.UUCP.It builds with the recipes in the project's tools/rebuild/recipes.psv:GNU cpp for the <sys/...> headers, DEFS/os9unix ahead of DEFS/blarsdefs forthe baud-rate codes term.c switches on, and blarslib.l and termlib.l.